        "original_id": "aa49a373-bd1a-596d-ad21-a575ab713a63",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Gubman, Kim Jung Ju, Jake Song\n- Companies: Nexon, Ubisoft, Sony Online Interactive, Activision, Square Enix, Konami, Electronic Arts, GSN, Storm8, Gree, Playdom, PlayFirst, Disney Online Interactive\n- Places: Seoul, South Korea\n- Topics: Video game music composition, Company founding\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, Kim Jung Ju and Jake Song founded Nexon in Seoul, South Korea.\n- Adam Gubman has composed music for more than 550 video games.\n- Adam Gubman has composed music for video games for prominent interactive software development companies including Ubisoft, Nexon, Sony Online Interactive, Activision, Square Enix, Konami, Electronic Arts, GSN, Storm8, Gree, Playdom, PlayFirst, and Disney Online Interactive.",
